ATTRIBUTION FOR SCOPE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The grammar-point inventory this book covers -- which patterns, at which JLPT
level -- follows the list published at https://jlptgrammarlist.neocities.org/.
That site supplied the syllabus only. No text, example sentence or translation
from it appears in this book. It is unaffiliated with this project and has not
reviewed or endorsed it.
